# dragging: no line off the left edge, no characters off the right
# (CGBetaChanges); once at an edge, dragging further changes nothing.
# Shots in preview (Alt-Help): without the cursor; run.sh compares above the bar.
KEY 49
KEY 49
KEY 49
DRAG 300 160 -400 160
KEY 5f 0 2
SHOT build/test/drag-left.png
KEY 5f 0 2
DRAG 40 160 -300 160
KEY 5f 0 2
SHOT build/test/drag-left2.png
KEY 5f 0 2
DRAG 40 160 1400 160
KEY 5f 0 2
SHOT build/test/drag-right.png
KEY 5f 0 2
DRAG 700 160 1500 160
KEY 5f 0 2
SHOT build/test/drag-right2.png
